id: psychic-counter
name: Psychic Counter
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 4
psychicCounter: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Targeted by Telekinesis: a Might Clash - won, it fails, and yours back for a Counter Action.
text: >
  Psychic Counter: You can contest your opponent’s telekinesis with your own.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: If you are targeted by another Character using the Telekinesis Unique Ability, you may initiate a Might Clash.
  If you win, they fail to target you with Telekinesis and you may spend 1 Counter Action to use the Telekinesis Unique
  Ability to target that Opponent as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
